ui.monoid Liquid Glass (liquid-glass)
Copyright 2026 still.fail contributors

This library is a port of the component catalog of AndroidLiquidGlass
(catalog/components, catalog/utils, catalog/destinations) to mbui's window
tree, in MoonBit. Every number it draws with (colours, sizes, springs, lens
heights and amounts, highlights, shadows) is the catalog's.

